Re vim: Quite likely, but markdown per se is an output of knitr, so the logical thing to do is recognize the distinction between knitr-pandoc and pandoc by making a new vim-knitr-pandoc highlight definitions file.

Disclaimer: I don't use vim for any significant amount of work, so it might be a chore to do any of this.

